# B70 Inference Host — Agent Contract

Intel Arc Pro B70 32 GB | llama.cpp SYCL and vLLM XPU

This file is the concise mandatory operating contract. Detailed research conclusions, live inventory, campaign narratives, and historical benchmark numbers live in their typed authorities.

## 1. Locate the host before acting

```bash
hostname
pwd -P
```

If the hostname is `b70-host`, operate locally. **Do not SSH to `<lab-host>` from the B70 itself**; self-SSH fails and is unnecessary.

When controlling the B70 from another board, use the documented remote path. Telegram/Radxa operations are separate and must be explicitly requested.

